---
source: forge-ci/tests/surface.rs
expression: "forge_ci(&[\"--help\"])"
---
exit: 0
--- stdout
The CI of a nixos-forge flake: each subcommand is one step of its workflows

Usage: forge-ci <COMMAND>

Commands:
  plan             Plan the CI run: the checks to build, the ones skipped and why, as GITHUB_OUTPUT lines
  build            Build one check and write its result, excerpt and evidence
  report           Write the report of a CI run from its results, for the run summary or a comment
  promote          Move the deploy branch of every host whose checks passed
  badges           Write, publish or read the badges of the badges branch
  reproducibility  Build every system twice and compare the builds
  flaky            Run one VM check several times and record each run
  flaky-plan       Plan the VM checks whose flakiness this tree has not measured yet
  flaky-report     Write the flaky report and the history of the runs
  help             Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
--- stderr
